{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12117","headline":"冬夜题旅馆 · 钱起","name":"冬夜题旅馆","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"退飞忆林薮，乐业羡黎庶。\n四海尽穷途，一枝无宿处。\n严冬北风急，中夜哀鸿去。\n孤烛思何深，寒窗坐难曙。\n劳歌待明发，惆怅盈百虑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12117.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12117","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}